# Normalise line endings so the repo is the same on Windows and macOS. The
# design system is vendored in from a shared folder, so without this every
# `npm run sync:ds` on a different machine would show as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
